In a[ on]-demand webinar,[ employment] law experts Pam Dev[ata], partner at Chicago-based[ Se]yfarth Shaw LLP[,] and Courtney Stieber, senior associate at[ Se]yfarth Shaw, will[ address frequently] asked[ questions regarding] the FCRA[ and] share best practice[ responses for ensuring your company stays] FC[RA compliant].[]

