Great reminders that "said["] and "asked["] are invisible to the reader. The only other one I like to use (sparingly) is "whispered."
Good post. I don't like adverb tags, either. The[ content] of your[ writing] should tell[ you] if your[ are] acting mischiev[ously or] skept[ically.] You see these tags a[ lot] in older books.
I don't mind the occasional adverb tag,[ as] long[ as it]'s not

